OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters block roads in
OL,4,APortsmouth after 140 migrants arrive in
OL,5,Aboat
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of protesters gathered in
OL,8,FPortsmouth on Sunday night after around
OL,9,F140 migrants arrived in a single dinghy
OL,10,Fthat had crossed the English Channel.
OL,12,FIn the second major anti-migrant
OL,13,Fprotest of the weekend, police faced
OL,14,Foff with demonstrators as they blocked
OL,15,Froads in an effort to stop the people
OL,16,Fwho had arrived on the boat from
OL,17,Fleaving the city.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
