OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters block roads in
OL,4,APortsmouth after 140 migrants arrive in
OL,5,Aboat
OL,6,
OL,7,FHampshire Police urged people to avoid
OL,8,Fthe Eastney Landing ferry port area,
OL,9,Fwhere the migrants were brought ashore,
OL,10,Fand said a dispersal order was in
OL,11,Fplace, meaning anyone failing to comply
OL,12,Fcould be arrested.
OL,14,FThe government condemned "the
OL,15,Fintimidating and thuggish behaviour" of
OL,16,Fthe protesters, many of whom were
OL,17,Fdressed in black and wore masks.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
